{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:aba061e79d377d2b","name":"Holowan Mechanicals","source":{"id":"source:reference-aba061e79d377d2b","title":"Holowan Mechanicals","revision":24492,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T15:33:25Z","sha256":"18d412f4c299e75bbafc0dccfd83f856510e34eaee398c95da1314e2c89438e8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24492","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Holowan%20Mechanicals&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-aba061e79d377d2b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Holowan Mechanicals is best known for developing the IG-Series Droids. The IG-Series designs are obtained through the acquisition of assets from Phlut Design Systems by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The InterGalactic Banking Clan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_InterGalactic_Banking_Clan","referenceId":"reference:c1d3bf539d4931a9"},". During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["IG-100 MagnaGuards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IG-100_MagnaGuards"}," serve prominently as General Grievous's personal bodyguards. However, when developing the IG Assassination Droid series, Holowan technicians seriously underestimate the lethality of their design, eventually losing the entire team to the escaped prototypes, setting back Holowan as a competitive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," producer for years to come.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Manufacturer Traits:"]}," Holowan units are designed for lethality. Once per encounter, a Holowan Droid can add 1 die of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage"}," to an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
